      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA DUANE (8) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Finished third latest over 537m at this track (31.53) in a Grade 3/4/5 but is better suited here over less ground. Form here at this distance is sound including three wins. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Good form should continue. TERRITORY TUFF (1) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 383m behind Enigma Go (22.80) in a Free For All. Shapes as one to consider. BING BING SECRET (5) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when second beaten a neck (31.52). Drops back in trip for this. Overdue and gets her chance. DANIEL SPARKLES (4) cannot be left out after placing at a big quote last start.",
